1
00:00:00,270 --> 00:00:03,325
Where on Earth could we investigate landscapes like Mars?

2
00:00:03,365 --> 00:00:06,125
PARALLAX X compares real Martian terrain

3
00:00:06,165 --> 00:00:09,355
with 1,915 selected Earth windows.

4
00:00:09,395 --> 00:00:12,925
Five exploratory candidates emerge in Mongolia's Gobi.

5
00:00:12,965 --> 00:00:16,000
But our method failed its pre-registered validation.

6
00:00:16,120 --> 00:00:18,542
So Expedition Lab turns uncertainty

7
00:00:18,582 --> 00:00:21,430
into testable rover field-experiment plans.

8
00:00:21,470 --> 00:00:23,880
Some things, only fieldwork can measure.

9
00:00:24,365 --> 00:00:25,525
PARALLAX X.

10
00:00:25,565 --> 00:00:27,100
Similarity is not proof.

11
00:00:27,140 --> 00:00:28,675
Evidence comes first.

